 "headline": "Shai Drops 38 On The Bench",
 "notes": [
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts left Shai Gilgeous-Alexander on the bench for 38 points, 7 assists and four threes. The manager is up 8-2 anyway, which is the only reason he's not crying.",
  "White Mambas took 3PT% from Adam Silver Dez Nuts and still trail 8-2. Ryan Rollins shot 3-for-8 for 6 points. That's the contribution.",
  "Jaden McDaniels hung 34 points, 10 boards, 6 dimes and four threes for Thug Life. MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f lead 7-4 anyway, because Barnes and Herro both topped 30.",
  "LeParth James flipped 3PTM back, so Svi Mykhailiuk (2 points, 1-for-5) and Anfernee Simons (3 points, 1-for-3) apparently aren't why he's down. Lead is 6-5, barely.",
  "Suggs to be you took DREB from Zero Fox Given behind Kevin Durant's 32 points and Moussa Diabat\u00e9's 10-10 double-double. Myles Turner's 27-and-11 wasn't enough."
 ],
